   "answer": "To find the cost of 7 pens, we need to multiply the cost of one pen by the number of pens.\n\nCost of one pen = 3 euros\nNumber of pens = 7\n\nCost of 7 pens = Cost of one pen * Number of pens\n= 3 euros * 7\n= 21 euros\n\nSo, the cost of 7 pens is \\boxed{21} euros."
  }
